{#
   Owner Spotlight / The Rich List (#owner-spotlight) — the richest owners in the
   game, each with up to OwnerSpotlightService::CLUBS_PER_OWNER of their clubs and
   the division each sits in.

   Now a top-level section. It used to be included from _story.html.twig, sitting
   inside Journey Chapter 01 as that chapter's payoff; the redesign gives it its
   own slot after the no-pay-to-win band, where it reads as a leaderboard rather
   than as chapter furniture. Owners are avatars, not real people, and the data is
   the game's own.

   Two layouts, per the design, because rank 1 is the only row with room for a
   scene: a full-width gold leader card (full-body owner sprite + that owner's
   own stadium) and a 4-up grid of head-avatar cards for ranks 2-5. Both share
   the .ospot-* namespace, distinct from the Club Spotlight's .spotlight-* it
   borrows its visual family from, so restyling one never silently restyles the
   other.

   Club rows use the TWO-LINE layout — badge + kit + name on line one, tier chip
   and division on line two. The single-line version collapses a long club name
   to one letter per line at grid-card width, which is why the design specifies
   this explicitly.

   ownerSpotlight is computed live behind a 10-minute cache
   (OwnerSpotlightService), unlike the cron-refreshed Club Spotlight — it is two
   indexed queries, not an aggregate over sync payloads.

   Ranked on UserLedger dividends actually drawn, NOT on combined club balance
   and NOT on Club::$totalCareerEarnings. Only owners holding ledger entries
   appear, so fewer than OWNER_LIMIT is normal and the whole section renders nothing
   when none do — which is the design's own "hidden entirely until at least one
   owner qualifies" state (see design/States.dc.html).

   sharePct is a share of the LEADER's total, not of the board total, and is
   computed server-side: the template only ever sees the rows it renders, so it
   cannot work out a denominator that includes anyone it is not showing. 0.0 when
   the leader is 0, which an all-zero board makes a real state.

   stadiumConfig is sent for rank 1 only — four extra ClubFacility queries for
   cards that never draw one — so a null here means "not the leader", not
   "no stadium".

   Avatars render client-side from data-owner-appearance via
   composePlayerSpriteSvg(). Owner identity is newer than most accounts, so a
   null appearance is common; the slot stays empty rather than drawing a default
   face attributed to a named owner.

   Country chips are flag SVGs from public/assets/flags/, keyed by the
   lower-cased App\Enum\Country code (see that directory's README for provenance,
   and for why England is en.svg). Each carries the country name as alt AND
   title, so the flag is never the only carrier of which country it is — an
   18x13 flag is not reliably identifiable. Explicitly sized so the row does not
   reflow as flags decode.

   The JS hooks are load-bearing: landing.js walks `.ospot-row`, then
   `.ospot-avatar-slot` / `.ospot-stadium-slot` / `.ospot-club`'s
   `.ospot-club-badge` within it. `.ospot-row` is one owner's CARD, in both
   layouts — keep the class on whatever element wraps a single owner.
#}
{% import _self as ui %}

{% if ownerSpotlight is not empty %}
{% set leader = ownerSpotlight|first %}
{% set rest = ownerSpotlight|slice(1) %}

<section class="ospot-section" id="owner-spotlight" aria-labelledby="ospot-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Owner Spotlight</div>
        <div class="ospot-board-head">
            <h2 class="pixel" id="ospot-title">THE RICH LIST</h2>
            <span class="ospot-header-sub vt">Top {{ ownerSpotlight|length }} {{ ownerSpotlight|length == 1 ? 'owner' : 'owners' }} by dividends drawn</span>
        </div>

        {# <ol>, not a div grid: the ranking is the content, so it lives in the
           markup rather than only in the rendered rank glyph. The second list
           carries start="2" so ranks 2-7 are numbered correctly on their own. #}
        <ol class="ospot-leader-list">
            <li class="ospot-row ospot-leader"
                data-ospot-crop="full"
                data-owner-appearance="{{ leader.ownerAppearance|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
                data-stadium-config="{{ leader.stadiumConfig|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">

                <div class="ospot-leader-scene">
                    <span class="ospot-rank-chip pixel">
                        <span class="visually-hidden">Rank </span>01 · TOP DRAWER
                    </span>
                    <span class="ospot-avatar-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="ospot-stadium-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                </div>

                <div class="ospot-leader-body">
                    <div class="ospot-head">
                        <div class="ospot-identity">
                            <div class="ospot-owner-name pixel">{{ leader.ownerName }}</div>
                            <div class="ospot-owner-meta vt">
                                {% if leader.ownerCountryCode %}
                                    <img class="ospot-flag"
                                         src="{{ asset('assets/flags/' ~ leader.ownerCountryCode|lower ~ '.svg') }}?v={{ landing_v }}"
                                         width="18" height="13" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                                         alt="{{ leader.ownerNationality }}" title="{{ leader.ownerNationality }}">
                                {% endif %}
                                {{ leader.clubCount }} {{ leader.clubCount == 1 ? 'club' : 'clubs' }}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ospot-balance">
                            <div class="ospot-balance-val pixel">£{{ (leader.drawnPence / 100)|round(0, 'floor')|number_format }}</div>
                            <div class="ospot-balance-lbl vt">DRAWN</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="ospot-share" role="img" aria-label="Share of the leader's total: {{ leader.sharePct|round }}%">
                        <span class="ospot-share-fill" style="width:{{ leader.sharePct|round(1) }}%"></span>
                    </div>

                    {% if leader.clubs is not empty %}
                        <div class="ospot-clubs-head vt">
                            <span>CLUBS</span>
                            {# A plain count, never a toggle: the payload is capped at
                               CLUBS_PER_OWNER, so the remaining clubs are not on the
                               page to reveal. #}
                            {% if leader.clubCount > leader.clubs|length %}
                                <span>+{{ leader.clubCount - leader.clubs|length }} more</span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                        {{ ui.clubList(leader.clubs, landing_v) }}
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </li>
        </ol>

        {% if rest is not empty %}
            <ol class="ospot-grid" start="2">
                {% for owner in rest %}
                    <li class="ospot-row ospot-card"
                        data-ospot-crop="head"
                        data-owner-appearance="{{ owner.ownerAppearance|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">

                        <div class="ospot-head">
                            <span class="ospot-rank pixel">
                                <span class="visually-hidden">Rank </span>{{ '%02d'|format(owner.rank) }}
                            </span>
                            <span class="ospot-avatar-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            <span class="ospot-identity">
                                <span class="ospot-owner-name pixel">{{ owner.ownerName }}</span>
                                <span class="ospot-owner-meta vt">
                                    {% if owner.ownerCountryCode %}
                                        <img class="ospot-flag"
                                             src="{{ asset('assets/flags/' ~ owner.ownerCountryCode|lower ~ '.svg') }}?v={{ landing_v }}"
                                             width="18" height="13" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                                             alt="{{ owner.ownerNationality }}" title="{{ owner.ownerNationality }}">
                                    {% endif %}
                                    {{ owner.clubCount }} {{ owner.clubCount == 1 ? 'club' : 'clubs' }}
                                </span>
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="ospot-balance-row">
                            <span class="ospot-balance-val pixel">£{{ (owner.drawnPence / 100)|round(0, 'floor')|number_format }}</span>
                            <span class="ospot-balance-lbl vt">DRAWN</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="ospot-share" role="img" aria-label="Share of the leader's total: {{ owner.sharePct|round }}%">
                            <span class="ospot-share-fill" style="width:{{ owner.sharePct|round(1) }}%"></span>
                        </div>

                        {% if owner.clubs is not empty %}
                            {{ ui.clubList(owner.clubs, landing_v) }}
                        {% endif %}
                    </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ol>
        {% endif %}

        <p class="ospot-note">
            Dividends drawn across every club an owner holds, as reported by the app and
            refreshed every few minutes. Owners appear by display name only.
            <a href="#privacy">How we handle your data</a>.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{#
   One club row, shared by both layouts so the two-line structure cannot drift
   between the leader card and the grid cards.

   Every club shows at least its badge — clubBadgeIconsHtml() falls back to
   composeKitSvg()'s own defaults, so a club that has never customised its
   identity still draws something. The kit rides along in the same helper output
   and is hidden by CSS on the narrowest cards, where the row has no width for
   both.
#}
{% macro clubList(clubs, landing_v) %}
    <ul class="ospot-clubs">
        {% for club in clubs %}
            <li class="ospot-club"
                data-club-badge="{{ {home: club.homeKitConfig, away: club.awayKitConfig, badge: club.badgeConfig}|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">
                <span class="ospot-club-badge" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="ospot-club-name">
                    {{ club.name }}
                    {% if club.countryCode %}
                        {% set clubCountry = club.countryLabel ?? club.countryCode %}
                        <img class="ospot-flag"
                             src="{{ asset('assets/flags/' ~ club.countryCode|lower ~ '.svg') }}?v={{ landing_v }}"
                             width="18" height="13" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                             alt="{{ clubCountry }}" title="{{ clubCountry }}">
                    {% endif %}
                </span>
                <span class="ospot-club-division">
                    {% if club.tier %}<span class="ospot-tier pixel">T{{ club.tier }}</span>{% endif %}
                    {{ club.division }}
                </span>
            </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
{% endmacro %}
